## Authentication

Every API endpoint (except `GET /api/version` and `GET /api/search`) requires authentication. Two methods are accepted:

- **Session cookie** — automatically used when you are logged in to the admin panel.
- **API key header** — send `X-API-Key: {{if .APIKey}}{{.APIKey}}{{else}}<your-key>{{end}}` in the request. The key is set via the `API_KEY` environment variable.

{{if eq .APIKey ""}}
> **Warning:** The `API_KEY` environment variable is not set on this page. The API cannot be used with key-based authentication.
{{end}}

Unauthenticated requests receive:

```http
HTTP/1.1 401 Unauthorized
Content-Type: application/json

{"error":"Hitelesítés szükséges"}
```

**curl example (API key):**

```bash
curl -H "X-API-Key: {{if .APIKey}}{{.APIKey}}{{else}}YOUR_KEY{{end}}" {{if .SiteURL}}{{.SiteURL}}{{else}}https://example.com{{end}}/api/articles
```

## Deletion safeguards

Deletion is blocked only when it would orphan active content or break an active workflow. Personal preferences such as follows and saved articles never block an editorial deletion.

Protected deletion requests return `409 Conflict` with an actionable payload:

```json
{
  "error": {
    "code": "resource_in_use",
    "resource": {"type": "category", "id": "..."},
    "dependencies": [{"type": "article", "count": 3}],
    "suggested_action": "Rendeld át vagy távolítsd el a hivatkozó aktív tartalmat."
  }
}
```

| Resource | Blocks deletion | Does not block deletion |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Category | Any non-deleted article, including drafts and scheduled articles | Personal category follows; removed automatically |
| Author | Any non-deleted article | Personal author follows; removed automatically |
| Page | Direct child pages | — |
| Article | —; articles are soft-deleted | Saved articles; removed automatically |

The feature-flagged admin modules follow the same rule: forum and marketplace categories cannot be removed when they have children or live content; marketplace delivery types cannot be removed while live listings use them; webshop categories and manufacturers cannot be removed while still in use.

