## Authors

### List authors

| Method | URL | Auth |
| --- | --- | --- |
| GET | `/api/authors` | Required |

**Response:**

```json
{
  "total": 5,
  "authors": [
    {
      "id":         "664a000000000000000000aa",
      "name":       "Jane Doe",
      "slug":       "jane-doe",
      "bio":        "Senior writer covering technology.",
      "avatar_url": "{{if .SiteURL}}{{.SiteURL}}{{else}}https://example.com{{end}}/images/jane.jpg",
      "created_at": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}
```

### Get one author

| Method | URL | Auth |
| --- | --- | --- |
| GET | `/api/authors/{id}` | Required |

**Response 200:** single author object.
**Response 404:** `{"error":"..."}`

### Create author

| Method | URL | Auth |
| --- | --- | --- |
| POST | `/api/authors` | Required |

| Field | Type | Required | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `name` | string | Yes | Slug is auto-generated. |
| `bio` | string | | |
| `avatar_url` | string | | URL to avatar image. If S3 is configured, external URLs are auto-imported to the media library. |

```bash
curl -X POST -H "X-API-Key: {{if .APIKey}}{{.APIKey}}{{else}}YOUR_KEY{{end}}" -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"name":"Jane Doe","bio":"Senior writer.","avatar_url":"{{if .SiteURL}}{{.SiteURL}}{{else}}https://example.com{{end}}/jane.jpg"}' \
  {{if .SiteURL}}{{.SiteURL}}{{else}}https://example.com{{end}}/api/authors
```

**Response 201:** created author object.

### Update author

| Method | URL | Auth |
| --- | --- | --- |
| PUT | `/api/authors/{id}` | Required |

Same fields as Create. Slug is always regenerated from the updated name.

```bash
curl -X PUT -H "X-API-Key: {{if .APIKey}}{{.APIKey}}{{else}}YOUR_KEY{{end}}" -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"name":"Jane Doe","bio":"Updated bio."}' \
  {{if .SiteURL}}{{.SiteURL}}{{else}}https://example.com{{end}}/api/authors/664a000000000000000000aa
```

**Response 200:** updated author object.

### Delete author

| Method | URL | Auth |
| --- | --- | --- |
| DELETE | `/api/authors/{id}` | Required |

> **Warning:** An author cannot be deleted while non-deleted articles reference it. Author follows are removed automatically and do not block deletion. A blocked request returns `409 resource_in_use` with the article count.

```bash
curl -X DELETE -H "X-API-Key: {{if .APIKey}}{{.APIKey}}{{else}}YOUR_KEY{{end}}" \
  {{if .SiteURL}}{{.SiteURL}}{{else}}https://example.com{{end}}/api/authors/664a000000000000000000aa
```

**Response 200:** `{"message":"A szerző sikeresen törölve"}`

**Response 409:** `resource_in_use` when active articles reference the author.

